<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>propertieslint</title><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/</link><description>Recent content on propertieslint</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><copyright>[© Apache License 2.0](https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt)</copyright><atom:link href="https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-spacing/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-spacing/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="comment-spacing"&gt;Comment spacing&lt;a class="anchor" href="#comment-spacing"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Comments must have no leading whitespace and exactly one space after &lt;code&gt;#&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; # You are reading a comment&#10;#You are reading a comment&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;# You are reading a comment&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-style/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-style/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="comment-style"&gt;Comment style&lt;a class="anchor" href="#comment-style"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Use &lt;code&gt;#&lt;/code&gt; for comments.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;! You are reading a comment&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;# You are reading a comment&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-trimming/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-trimming/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="comment-trimming"&gt;Comment trimming&lt;a class="anchor" href="#comment-trimming"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Empty comments at the beginning or end of a comment block with content must be&#10;removed. Empty comments between non-empty comments are allowed as separators.&#10;A block containing only empty comments is handled by&#10;&lt;a href="https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/no-empty-comment/"&gt;no-empty-comment&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;#&#10;# one&#10;#&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;# one&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/no-empty-comment/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/no-empty-comment/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-empty-comment"&gt;No empty comment&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-empty-comment"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Comment blocks must have content. A block containing only empty comments is&#10;invalid. If a block contains at least one non-empty comment, leading or trailing&#10;empty comments are handled by &lt;a href="https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/comment/comment-trimming/"&gt;comment-trimming&lt;/a&gt;, and&#10;interior empty comments are allowed as separators.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;#&#10;#&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/no-dangling-continuation/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/no-dangling-continuation/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-dangling-continuation"&gt;No dangling continuation&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-dangling-continuation"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Files cannot end with a dangling line continuation. A backslash (&lt;code&gt;\&lt;/code&gt;) at the&#10;end of a line continues the entry onto the next line, so it must be followed by&#10;one.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;multiline=line1\&#10;&#10;escape=this is backslash \&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;multiline=line1\&#10;line2&#10;&#10;escape=this is backslash \\&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/separator-style/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/separator-style/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="separator-style"&gt;Separator style&lt;a class="anchor" href="#separator-style"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Entries must use &lt;code&gt;=&lt;/code&gt; as the key/value separator.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;key:value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;key=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/valid-escape/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/format/valid-escape/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="valid-escape"&gt;Valid escape&lt;a class="anchor" href="#valid-escape"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Entries must have valid escape sequences. For example, unicode escapes must&#10;include four hexadecimal digits (&lt;code&gt;\u1234&lt;/code&gt;, not &lt;code&gt;\u123&lt;/code&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;unicode=\u123&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;unicode=\u1234&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/key-name/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/key-name/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="key-name"&gt;Key name&lt;a class="anchor" href="#key-name"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Keys can follow snake_case, camelCase or kebab-case, but not UPPERCASE.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;ITEM=value&#10;&#10;DATABASE_USER=admin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&#10;&#10;database.user=admin&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/key-order/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/key-order/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="key-order"&gt;Key order&lt;a class="anchor" href="#key-order"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Keys must be in alphabetical order, case-insensitively.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item2=value&#10;item1=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item1=value&#10;item2=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-duplicate-key/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-duplicate-key/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-duplicate-key"&gt;No duplicate key&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-duplicate-key"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Duplicate keys are not allowed.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&#10;item=other&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item1=value&#10;item2=other&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-empty-key/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-empty-key/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-empty-key"&gt;No empty key&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-empty-key"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Keys cannot be empty.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-empty-value/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/pair/no-empty-value/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-empty-value"&gt;No empty value&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-empty-value"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Values cannot be empty.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/entry-trimming/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/entry-trimming/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="entry-trimming"&gt;Entry trimming&lt;a class="anchor" href="#entry-trimming"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Keys and values cannot have leading or trailing whitespace.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; item = value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/no-duplicate-blank-line/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/no-duplicate-blank-line/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-duplicate-blank-line"&gt;No duplicate blank line&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-duplicate-blank-line"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Consecutive blank lines are not allowed.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item1=value&#10;&#10;&#10;item2=other&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item1=value&#10;&#10;item2=other&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/no-leading-blank-line/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/no-leading-blank-line/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="no-leading-blank-line"&gt;No leading blank line&lt;a class="anchor" href="#no-leading-blank-line"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;File cannot start with a blank line.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&#10;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title/><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/trailing-newline/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/rules/whitespace/trailing-newline/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="trailing-newline"&gt;Trailing newline&lt;a class="anchor" href="#trailing-newline"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;File must end with a newline character.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Before ❌&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;After ✅&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;item=value&#10;↵&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</description></item><item><title>All rules</title><link>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/book/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hanggrian.github.io/propertieslint/book/</guid><description/></item></channel></rss>